mask_refine.rgb_only = Ukususa imibala emaphethelweni kuyatholakala kumaleya we-RGB. Ukulungisa isifihli kuyasebenza kumodi yombala le.
mask_refine.too_large = Isifihli sidlula umkhawulo ophephileko womkhumbulo. Sebenzisa idokhumenti namkha indawo ekhethiweko encani.
mask_refine.processing = Kulungiswa isifihli ngekhwalithi epheleleko… Ungakhansela ngaphandle kokutjhugulula idokhumenti.
